                "text": "Everyone knows someone impacted by opioids. \n\nUnfortunately, settlement funds often fall short of addressing this crisis & accountability is needed. \n\nI joined @RepMarcyKaptur to ensure funds are used for treatment, prevention, education, & enforcement. https://t.co/Ek6YXVkLXo",
