                "source": "Twitter Media Studio",
                "text": "You may not always see it on news, but there\u2019s a lot of good, bipartisan work happening in Congress.\n \nI\u2019m proud to work across the aisle with @RepMarcyKaptur to ensure opioid settlement funds go toward treatment & prevention. https://t.co/b6L7AVbNyo",
